  feature-views/WatchFacePage/WatchFacePage.ViewModel.cs  (INotifyPropertyChanged state holder + ports + empty/noop default sources)
  feature-views/WatchFacePage/WatchFacePage.cs            (WinUI 3 UserControl, OLED wearable face + Helix narrator sibling — build-only, not headless-linked)
  TeslaSync.App.Tests/FeatureViews/WatchFacePageTests.cs  (35 headless tests)
  TeslaSync.App.Tests/TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj          (links the 3 UI-free files; the WinUI view is build-only)
